"What, you're looking for bungee gear!?{w}...Yeeesss! My time to shine!!"{w}{p}"Go to the vineyard on the roof and get some grapes!{w}Then I'll help you out!"{w}{p}"And besides the grapes, bring me a strong vine --
that's the raw material for the bungee rope."{w}{p}"As for the cushion, there's a samurai visiting 1F right now,
so get them to give you their floor cushion.{w}It's called the Handcrafted Zabutoon!!"{w}{p}"Grapes and a strong vine -- bring me both, got it!"{w}
